  "section": "1.108",
  "rulesText": "You can take the Help action to try to stabilize a creature with 0 Hit Points, which requires a successful DC 10 Wisdom (Medicine) check.\n\nA Stable creature doesn't make Death Saving Throws even though it has 0 Hit Points, but it still has the Unconscious condition. If the creature takes damage, it stops being Stable and starts making Death Saving Throws again. A Stable creature that isn't healed regains 1 Hit Point after 1d4 hours.",
  "mentionsCondition": [
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/conditions/unconscious"
    }
  ]
}
